<title>USA: U.S. Treasuries end higher after quiet session.</title>
<headline>U.S. Treasuries end higher after quiet session.</headline>
<text>
<p>*US Treasuries end higher after quiet session.</p>
<p>*Attention turns to next week's Humphrey Hawkins, new supply.</p>
<p>*Greenspan, Rivlin remarks ignored. Greenspan warns of market overregulation. Rivlin said wage pressures not yet a threat.</p>
<p>*Gains scored overseas held in U.S.</p>
